    source('src-kaylon-builders-reference', 'Kaylon', 'The Orville Wiki contributors', 'https://orville.fandom.com/wiki/Kaylon', 'secondary_tv_lore_reference_indexed', 'Public Builders, slavery, pain control and machine conflict paragraphs read', 'Artificial persons serve biological creators, rebel and outlast them.', 'Robot personhood, slavery and extinction do not establish the current machines’ post-work human economy or their builders’ general household distribution.'),
